{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If the object is in range, take it, otherwise move and scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />\"",
    "BT": {
